title: Start
tags: ace attorney short trial
---
<<curtain closed duration:0>>
<<stage define prosecution>>
<<stage define judge>>
<<stage define counsel>>
<<stage define witness>>
<<backdrop Defense stage:main scale:1>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand at:center scale:1>>
<<object defense_desk asset:backgrounds/Defense_Desk stage:main at:50,100 scale:1 z:100>>
<<backdrop Prosecution stage:prosecution scale:1>>
<<character Miles stage:prosecution appearance:stand at:center scale:1>>
<<object prosecution_desk asset:backgrounds/Prosecution_Desk stage:prosecution at:50,100 scale:1 z:100>>
<<backdrop Judge stage:judge scale:1>>
<<character Judge stage:judge appearance:stand at:center scale:1>>
<<object judge_desk asset:backgrounds/Judge_Desk stage:judge at:50,100 scale:1 z:100>>
<<backdrop Counsel stage:counsel scale:1>>
<<character Maya stage:counsel appearance:angry at:center scale:1>>
<<backdrop Witness stage:witness scale:1>>
<<character Dick stage:witness appearance:stand at:center scale:1>>
<<object witness_desk asset:backgrounds/Witness_Desk stage:witness at:50,100 scale:1 z:100>>
<<screen show counsel>>
// <<bgm Trial2001 volume:0.55>>
<<curtain open duration:0.5 wait:true>>

<<bgm Allegro2001 duration:0>>
Maya: 怎么能这样！明明是我们找出的矛盾！
<<screen show prosecution>>
<<character Miles stage:prosecution appearance:stand>>
Miles: 矛盾不属于任何一方。它只说明原先的解释不完整。
Miles: 被告八点四十分已经进入后台，有时间提前行凶。
<<screen show judge>>
<<character Judge stage:judge appearance:negative>>
Judge: 仅仅改变死亡时间，确实不足以排除被告。
Judge: 辩护人，你有证据证明，枪响之前他没有杀人吗？
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand>>
Phoenix: 我……
Phoenix: （拆掉了九点，反而替他打开了整整半小时的犯罪时间。）
<<stopBgm duration:0.4 wait:true>>
<<screen show counsel>>
<<character Maya stage:counsel appearance:thinking>>
Maya: 我们一直盯着声音。
Maya: 可是……那张照片里，经理还站着呢。
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand>>
Phoenix: 八点五十五分。照片里的经理，还活着。
<<screen show counsel>>
<<character Maya stage:counsel appearance:stand>>
Maya: 那就别问枪是什么时候响的了。
Maya: 问问那时候，被告在哪里！
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand>>
Phoenix: 裁判长，请允许我确认执勤摘要中省略的十分钟。
<<screen show judge>>
<<character Judge stage:judge appearance:stand>>
Judge: 只有一次机会。请直接问。
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand>>
Phoenix: 糸锯刑警，八点五十分，你处理纠纷之后做了什么？
<<screen show witness>>
<<character Dick stage:witness appearance:headscratch>>
Dick: 我把被告带到剧场外问话。他气得不轻，我怕他再回去吵起来。
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand>>
Phoenix: 问话持续到什么时候？
<<screen show witness>>
<<character Dick stage:witness appearance:stand>>
Dick: 广播响起来。然后我们一起跑回去的说。
<<screen show prosecution>>
<<character Miles stage:prosecution appearance:stand>>
Miles: 证人。在此期间，被告是否离开过你的视线？
<<screen show witness>>
<<character Dick stage:witness appearance:confident>>
Dick: 没有！他想回去拿外套，我都没答应！
<<wait 0.45>>
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:stand>>
Phoenix: 为什么执勤摘要没有写这一点？
<<screen show witness>>
<<character Dick stage:witness appearance:headscratch>>
Dick: 我以为九点就是案发时间……重点应该写发现尸体的经过。
Dick: 原始记录还在！八点五十分到九点，谈话一直没有中断的说！
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:desk_slam>>
<<wait 0.175>>
<<sfx deskslam>>
<<character fx Phoenix effect:shake stage:main axis:y duration:0.35 strength:18 frequency:24 wait:true>>
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:desk_slam>>
Phoenix: 请将原始记录与八点五十五分的照片，一起看。
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:point>>
Phoenix: 经理活着的时候，被告已经在刑警的看守之下。直到发现尸体，他都没有机会独自回到后台！
<<screen show prosecution>>
<<character Miles stage:prosecution appearance:stand>>
Miles: 但他拿起了现场的枪——
<<stopBgm duration:0 wait:true>>
<<screen show main>>
<<object objection asset:ui/ObjectionOverlay stage:main at:50,100 scale:1 z:200 via:cut>>
<<sfx Objection>>
<<object fx objection effect:shake stage:main axis:x duration:0.3 strength:12>>
<<wait 0.95>>
<<object hide objection stage:main via:cut>>
<<bgm Pursuit2001>>
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:point>>
Phoenix: 握住枪的那一刻，不等于扣下扳机的那一刻！
Phoenix: 刑警亲眼看见他从地上拾枪。那只能证明他碰过凶器，不能证明他开过枪！
<<screen show judge>>
<<character Judge stage:judge appearance:stand>>
Judge: 照片之后，被告始终与刑警在一起……
<<screen show main>>
<<character Phoenix stage:main appearance:point>>
Phoenix: 而检方主张的是近距离枪击，并没有任何定时开枪装置。
Phoenix: 这段录音没有为被告制造不在场证明。它把一个有不在场证明的人，引回了尸体旁！
<<screen show prosecution>>
<<character Miles stage:prosecution appearance:stand>>
Miles: ……
<<wait 0.6>>
<<stopBgm>>
<<screen show prosecution>>
<<curtain closed duration:0.8 wait:true>>
===
